{"title": "Shiv Sena corporator and aides accused of assaulting doctors in Thane hospital", "summary": "A Shiv Sena corporator and his aides have been accused of assaulting and abusing medical staff at a hospital in Thane. A case has been filed against six individuals, including the corporator. A political leader from a rival Shiv Sena faction called for strict action against the accused.", "summary_points": ["A Shiv Sena corporator and aides allegedly assaulted and abused doctors and staff at a Thane hospital.", "CCTV footage reportedly shows the corporator and supporters assaulting medical personnel.", "A case has been filed against six people, including the corporator.", "The accused corporator has denied the allegations.", "A leader from a rival Shiv Sena faction called for strict action from the Chief Minister."], "title_hi": "ठाणे अस्पताल में शिवसेना कॉर्पोरेटर और साथियों पर डॉक्टरों से मारपीट का आरोप", "summary_hi": "ठाणे के एक अस्पताल में शिवसेना के एक कॉर्पोरेटर और उसके साथियों पर चिकित्सा कर्मचारियों के साथ मारपीट और दुर्व्यवहार करने का आरोप है। कॉर्पोरेटर सहित छह लोगों के खिलाफ मामला दर्ज किया गया है। एक प्रतिद्वंद्वी शिवसेना गुट के एक नेता ने आरोपियों के खिलाफ कड़ी कार्रवाई की मांग की है।", "summary_points_hi": ["शिवसेना के एक कॉर्पोरेटर और साथियों पर ठाणे के एक अस्पताल में डॉक्टरों और कर्मचारियों से मारपीट और दुर्व्यवहार करने का आरोप है।", "सीसीटीवी फुटेज में कथित तौर पर कॉर्पोरेटर और समर्थकों को चिकित्सा कर्मियों पर हमला करते हुए दिखाया गया है।", "कॉर्पोरेटर सहित छह लोगों के खिलाफ मामला दर्ज किया गया है।", "आरोपी कॉर्पोरेटर ने आरोपों से इनकार किया है।", "एक प्रतिद्वंद्वी शिवसेना गुट के नेता ने मुख्यमंत्री से कड़ी कार्रवाई की मांग की है।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage focuses on the alleged assault at the hospital, reporting the details of the incident, the case filed, and the political reaction from a rival faction leader calling for action."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्रवादी कवरेज अस्पताल में कथित मारपीट पर केंद्रित है, जिसमें घटना के विवरण, दर्ज मामले और प्रतिद्वंद्वी गुट के नेता द्वारा कार्रवाई की मांग वाली राजनीतिक प्रतिक्रिया की रिपोर्टिंग की गई है।"}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132258893,imgsize-104569.cms", "sources": [{"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/parade-them-in-the-streets-sanjay-raut-to-fadnavis-after-shinde-sena-corporator-assaults-doctors-in-thane-hospital/articleshow/132258896.cms", "headline": "'Parade them in the streets': Sanjay Raut to Fadnavis after Shinde Sena corporator assaults doctors in Thane hospital"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Shiv Sena corporator, aides assault, abuse doctors at Thane hospital; case filed against six"}, {"source": "The Pioneer", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Ramesh Mhatre Regrets KDMC Hospital Assault, Denies Attacking Woman Doctor"}, {"source": "The Free Press Journal", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Thane Hospital Assault: UDF Says Violence Against Doctors Cannot Become Normal; MARD Announces Statewide"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/thane/shiv-sena-corporator-ramesh-mhatre-arrested-after-doctor-assault-video-sparks-massive-outrage/articleshow/132262648.cms", "headline": "Shiv Sena corporator arrested for assault on doctor, hospital staff in Thane"}, {"source": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/sena-corporator-who-assaulted-doctor-staff-at-thane-hospital-arrested-11744148", "headline": "Sena Corporator Who Assaulted Doctor, Staff At Thane Hospital Arrested"}, {"source": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/thane-dombivli-sh